"<p>Nitrobase is built from the ground up with native multi-tenancy. Every server, app, domain, destination, and backup schedule belongs to a <strong>Team</strong>.</p>\n<h2>RBAC Roles &#x26; Capabilities</h2>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th align=\"left\">Role</th><th align=\"center\">Server Management</th><th align=\"center\">Deploy Apps</th><th align=\"center\">View Secrets</th><th align=\"center\">Manage Team &#x26; Billing</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align=\"left\"><strong>Owner</strong></td><td align=\"center\">Full</td><td align=\"center\">Full</td><td align=\"center\">Full</td><td align=\"center\">Full</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><strong>Admin</strong></td><td align=\"center\">Full</td><td align=\"center\">Full</td><td align=\"center\">Full</td><td align=\"center\">Yes (Cannot delete team)</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><strong>Developer</strong></td><td align=\"center\">View Only</td><td align=\"center\">Full</td><td align=\"center\">Hidden / Masked</td><td align=\"center\">No</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><strong>Viewer</strong></td><td align=\"center\">View Only</td><td align=\"center\">Read Only</td><td align=\"center\">Hidden</td><td align=\"center\">No</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2>Inviting Members</h2>\n<p>Team administrators can generate one-time invite links under <strong>Settings -> Team -> Invites</strong>. Invites can be sent directly via email or copied manually.</p>"